problems with saving pages please let me know.

2014-06-05 16:34 GMT+04:00 la gleki <gleki.is.my.name@gmail.com>:

> As of June 6 2014.
>
> *main page optimizations to save space. The design in now lighter. Edit,
> history, viewsource, read tabs and "move/delete page" tabs are not shown
> for non-logged in users. The language interface is detected from GeoIP and
> your browser language preferences. Just visit http://mw.lojban.org to see
> it yourself
> *a new template jvs. Use {{jvs|broda}} to quickly link to words in
> jbovlaste
> *SimpleTable v. 2.0 extension installed. This allows to paste table
> directly from Excel or similar apps in tsv format (wrap the result with
> <tab> ... </tab>)
> *now it is possible to save article to Word or OpenOffice formats in the
> left sidebar
> *paragraphs are now justified on all pages
> *a nice trick for getting names of messages to localize to Lojban:
> http://mw.lojban.org/index.php?title=L17-01&uselang=qqx
> *OpenSearchXml extension installed. Now you'll see suggestions while
> typing in the search box.
>
>
>
> On Friday, March 14, 2014 6:45:53 PM UTC+4, la gleki wrote:
>>
>> As of March 14 2014.
>>
>>    - I've created a new main page. The main thing is that it allows the
>>    visitor to click on the flag of their native language and
>>       - not only the interface of the wiki will be changed to that
>>       language
>>       - but the user will be redirected to the welcome page in that
>>       language
>>       - and the left sidebar with useful links will be changed
>>       accordingly
>>       - http://mw.lojban.org/index.php?title=ralju_papri
>>    - Quiz extension for creating exercises installed
>>    - Wikiforum. To prevent spammers now only administrators can create
>>    new threads. However, even unregistered users can post to the forum. Thus
>>    we have a guestboard.
>>    - Collection extension installed allowing export of pages in nicely
>>    formatted pdf files.
>>
>>  --
